{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3UYqLQApwcPnNbzWpo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can only answer half of this. I found Lemonade's (LMND) actual FY2024 results, but I couldn't read the guidance figures, so I can't tell you whether the results beat, met or missed guidance.\n\n**FY2024 actual results (10-K XBRL data):**\n- Total revenue: **$526.5M**, up about 22% from $429.8M in FY2023\n- Net loss: **$(202.2)M**, smaller than the $(236.9)M loss in FY2023\n\n**Prior quarter's full-year guidance: not found with these tools.** The guidance is in the Q3 2024 shareholder letter, filed as an 8-K exhibit on 30 Oct 2024. A search confirmed that letter discusses full-year 2024 guidance for In Force Premium, revenue and Adjusted EBITDA. But the search tool only says which documents match. It doesn't show their text, and none of the other tools can open the exhibit. The guidance ranges aren't in the XBRL data either. The same gap applies to the actual FY2024 In Force Premium, gross earned premium and Adjusted EBITDA, which are in the Q4 letter (8-K, 25 Feb 2025) and also not in XBRL. I won't fill in guidance numbers from memory.\n\nTo finish the comparison, open the Q3 2024 letter (link below) and check the full-year 2024 revenue range against the $526.5M actual. Then compare the In Force Premium and Adjusted EBITDA guidance with the actuals in the Q4 2024 letter.\n\n**Sources**\n- Form 10-K for FY2024, filed 2025-02-26, accession 0001691421-25-000031 (XBRL: Revenues, NetIncomeLoss; FY2023 figures from the same data set)\n- Form 8-K (Q3 2024 shareholder letter, Items 2.02/9.01), filed 2024-10-30, accession 0001691421-24-000128. Found as containing the guidance, but the text couldn't be read: https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1691421/000169142124000128/lmndq32024shlfinal103024.htm\n- Form 8-K (Q4 2024 shareholder letter, Items 2.02/9.01), filed 2025-02-25, accession 0001691421-25-000021. Found, but the text couldn't be read."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":715,"cache_read_input_tokens":9118,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":715},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1560c1b-d02c-4f49-a696-c5d92b57cc1e","uuid":"128878d1-8750-433e-adcd-a7b8f79584c7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:16:07.940Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ3UYXz58c7CggFNymbQ"}
